{"turn_id": "d17-t1", "session_id": "d17", "turn": 1, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "test_set_size", "text": "The tests are conducted on the entire English-German WMT news-test2015 test set, which contains 2,169 sentences.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.10090", "chunk_id": "c-c4953b9c4ea7ec3abed8a6e0"}]}, {"key": "subset_for_length_constraints", "text": "Experiments with length constraints were conducted on only a subset of the test set to keep runtime under control.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.10090", "chunk_id": "c-3b5f0f612539d5cfc9f49e37"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d17-t1", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": false, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d17-t2", "session_id": "d17", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "test_set_definition", "text": "该论文使用精确搜索在完整的 WMT15 英德测试集上，为 Transformer 基础模型寻找全局最优的模型分数。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.10090", "chunk_id": "c-e75fba389a988f777decdfb0"}]}, {"key": "subset_reason", "text": "由于约束搜索会增加运行时间（因为下界更低），长度约束部分的所有结果都只在测试集的一个子集上进行，以将运行时间控制在可接受范围内。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.10090", "chunk_id": "c-3b5f0f612539d5cfc9f49e37"}]}, {"key": "subset_size_not_specified", "text": "所提供证据并未说明该子集包含多少句子，也未说明它具体如何从测试集中选取。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.10090", "chunk_id": "c-3b5f0f612539d5cfc9f49e37"}]}, {"key": "min_length_constraint", "text": "论文首先将搜索约束为长于源句长度 0.25 倍的译文，从而将空译文排除在搜索空间之外；这略微缓解了问题，但仍出现峰值，表明空译文问题是模型对较短假设的固有偏好所致，无法通过长度约束解决。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.10090", "chunk_id": "c-3b5f0f612539d5cfc9f49e37"}]}, {"key": "beam10_vs_reference_length", "text": "将精确搜索约束为最佳 Beam-10 假设的长度，相比束搜索没有改进；而约束为正确的参考长度（oracle 实验）则将 BLEU 分数提高了 0.9 分。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.10090", "chunk_id": "c-3b5f0f612539d5cfc9f49e37"}]}, {"key": "length_normalization_range", "text": "在长度归一化下，广义精确推理方案会在一定范围内寻找每种译文长度的最佳模型分数，例如从源句长度的零倍到 1.2 倍，初始下界取自 Beam-10 假设。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.10090", "chunk_id": "c-3b5f0f612539d5cfc9f49e37"}]}, {"key": "conclusion_length_heuristics", "text": "论文的结论指出，对长度约束精确搜索的研究表明，诸如长度归一化之类的简单启发式方法不太可能令人满意地解决该问题。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.10090", "chunk_id": "c-00d41f58b53cea9f062e6619"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d17-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
